            </summary>
            <div class="p-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
              The two cities sit only about 16 miles apart, so almost every trail on this list reads nearly
              the same from either one. Scranton is marginally closer to the Kittatinny Ridge cluster;
              Wilkes-Barre is marginally closer to Armenia Mountain to the northwest — the difference is
